{
  "info": {
    "name": "Fleter — finalizar viaje (Paso 3)",
    "description": "Recorrido de un viaje de PyME contra staging, simulando la ubicación del chofer en el body de iniciar y confirmar-parada. Verifica que confirmar la última parada ya no finaliza y que 'salir' de la última sí. Correr con el Collection Runner en orden (o `npx newman run`). Antes: poner firebase_api_key (la FIREBASE_WEB_API_KEY) en las variables de la colección. El viaje lleva motivo y descripcion (obligatorios) y no condiciones. El GPS por socket (conductor:ubicacion) no entra en una colección: está en sim-finalizar-viaje.mjs.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Armado (cuentas, PyME, chofer, vehículo, viaje)",
      "description": "Crea todo desde cero con emails sim+...@fleter.test. Correr una vez por recorrido.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Datos únicos para esta corrida",
                  "const s = String(Date.now()).slice(-8);",
                  "const azar = (n) => Array.from({ length: n }, () => Math.floor(Math.random() * 10)).join(\"\");",
                  "const pesos = [5,4,3,2,7,6,5,4,3,2];",
                  "let cuit;",
                  "for (;;) {",
                  "  const base = \"30\" + azar(8);",
                  "  const r = base.split(\"\").reduce((a, d, i) => a + Number(d) * pesos[i], 0) % 11;",
                  "  const dv = r === 0 ? 0 : 11 - r;",
                  "  if (dv !== 10) { cuit = base + dv; break; }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"sufijo\", s);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"email_pyme\", \"sim+pyme-\" + s + \"@fleter.test\");",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"email_chofer\", \"sim+chofer-\" + s + \"@fleter.test\");",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"password\", \"Sim-\" + s);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"dni_pyme\", azar(8));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"dni_chofer\", azar(8));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cuit\", cuit);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"patente\", \"SM\" + s.slice(-5));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar PyME (cliente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/registro-cliente",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "registro-cliente"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Pyme\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Sim {{sufijo}}\",\n  \"dni\": \"{{dni_pyme}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email_pyme}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "// Loguea la cuenta recién registrada en Firebase y guarda el idToken.",
                  "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"email_pyme\");",
                  "const pass = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"password\");",
                  "pm.sendRequest({",
                  "  url: \"https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key=\" + pm.variables.get(\"firebase_api_key\"),",
                  "  method: \"POST\",",
                  "  header: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },",
                  "  body: { mode: \"raw\", raw: JSON.stringify({ email, password: pass, returnSecureToken: true }) },",
                  "}, (err, res) => {",
                  "  pm.test(\"login Firebase pyme\", () => pm.expect(res.json().idToken, JSON.stringify(res.json())).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_pyme\", res.json().idToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
